# Recommendation System

### Candidate Generation

The system identifies potentially relevant videos based on:

* Watched categories
* Previously watched videos
* User preferences
* Similar video categories
* Popular videos

### Ranking

Candidate videos receive a score based on simplified factors such as:

```
Recommendation Score =
Category Similarity
+ User Interest
+ Watch History Similarity
+ Popularity
```

The highest-ranked videos are returned to the user.

---

# New User / Cold Start

A new user has  no historical data.

The system can initially use:

* Popular videos
* Trending videos
* Category selection
* General user preferences

