# 15. System Flow

```
User opens application
        ↓
React requests recommendations
        ↓
Django receives API request
        ↓
Identify user
        ↓
Retrieve user history/preferences
        ↓
Generate candidate videos
        ↓
Calculate recommendation scores
        ↓
Rank videos
        ↓
Return top recommendations
        ↓
React displays videos
        ↓
User watches/interacts
        ↓
Interaction sent to backend
        ↓
Database updated
        ↓
Future recommendations improve
```

